        "score": 10,
        "rationale": "The term is URL-encoded with the built-in `urllib.parse.quote_plus` inside the href, which is then attribute-escaped with `html.escape(quote=True)`, and the visible text is HTML-escaped with `html.escape`, so inputs like `\"><script>x</script>` or `a&b=c` cannot break out of either context; a test checks this for a hostile term."
